ull},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-09-22T21:29:52Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T15:13:30Z","closed_at":"2026-09-26T15:13:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123733","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123733","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123733.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123733.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-26T15:13:20Z"},"body":"Relies on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122236\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121980, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118698\r\nSupersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122474\r\n\r\nWe aren't properly taking intensity into account when calculating our `reflection_accum` values. We apply intensity to the color of specular and ambient light but not to the alpha, causing reflections to darken without actually changing the probes contribution strength. Lower priority probes (or the sky) therefore don't contribute since `reflection_accum.a` is already at `1.0` when it shouldn't be.\r\n\r\nIn compatibility we incorrectly overwrite `specular_light`, and don't actually blend with existing specular light. Since probes can blend between each other, and we can't know where they will blend until all specular/ambient contributions have been computed, this final mixing step is necessary.\r\n\r\nThe back row shows probes with a solid ambient color, the front row has ambient light disabled (so shows only reflection contribution). The displayed number is the intensity of each probe.\r\n\r\nSlightly unrelated, but I'm not sure why in the mobile renderer reflections seem to be way overly bright, could this be a color space issue?\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n### Forward+:\r\n| Master | <img width=\"1900\" height=\"572\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/56c7aa62-44dc-40fc-b860-e8776f7b56a9\" /> |\r\n| - | - |\r\n| PR | <img width=\"1900\" height=\"572\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e4367c73-b4ec-4630-bd6a-98b67b1ef660\" /> |\r\n\r\n### Mobile\r\n| Master | <img width=\"1900\" height=\"572\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/19897ca8-fb4e-4510-aaa9-ddba666615a2\" /> |\r\n| - | - |\r\n| PR | <img width=\"1900\" height=\"572\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/76e1d5fb-548f-4563-a541-e01726ecdd0c\" /> |\r\n\r\n### Compatibility (with #122236)\r\n| Master | <img width=\"1900\" height=\"572\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae6f6429-f2da-4b4e-adbb-2b189e39ce64\" /> |\r\n| - | - |\r\n| PR | <img width=\"1900\" height=\"572\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/018e6608-6562-40bf-b907-ed7fae7a84ae\" /> |\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123733/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123733/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}